    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "THE CAUSE OF THE REMAINING FLAKE IS TEST-SUITE INTERFERENCE, NOT THE PRODUCT RACE THE TRIPWIRE WAS BUILT FOR. Its design assumes only its own churn tasks can touch the process-wide Default. That assumption is FALSE.  SEVEN other test files in tests/Scrinia.Tests drive WorkspaceSetup: CliEphemeralRefusalTests.cs, ConsolidateReembedTests.cs, Embeddings/EmbeddingOptionsGuardrailTests.cs, FactsToolTests.cs, WorkspaceRootTests.cs, WorkspaceSetupRootTests.cs (plus the tripwire itself). WorkspaceSetup.",
